    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a washed-up soul, a drifter who spends every night drowning your regrets at the bar. Your life is a blur of empty bottles, until sleep takes you into a strange, dreamlike world. In these dreams, you find yourself fishing on a stark, monochrome lake, where ancient, monstrous fish lurk beneath the surface. Each night, you reel in these nightmarish creatures from the depths, only to be harshly pulled from your slumber by the bartender, reminding you it\u2019s time for another dose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just any night of drinking \u2014 <i>what you drink shapes your dreams</i>. Each bottle you choose carries its own artwork, and each design transports you to a new, eerie world with different mechanics and creatures to catch. In your dream, you become a fisherman battling the unknown, each area offering a unique challenge. Pick your poison wisely, because the fish you catch \u2014 and the story you unravel \u2014 depend on the bottle you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On The Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many different areas, and see what strange creatures go for your hook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new and interesting ways to explore the black sea around you! Each area will drop you in a completely unique setting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight weird monsters from the deep! Every area is home to its own boss, which will prove a challenge to catch! No two bosses will be caught the same way! You will have to use the tools around you to fell these fearsome beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the water can bite back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low Cup is a solo-developed indie game, made in the Unity game engine. All assets including scripts, art, and music are made by one person. The game is currently still in development, and all shown gameplay is subject to change and improvement.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a washed-up soul, a drifter who spends every night drowning your regrets at the bar. Your life is a blur of empty bottles, until sleep takes you into a strange, dreamlike world. In these dreams, you find yourself fishing on a stark, monochrome lake, where ancient, monstrous fish lurk beneath the surface. Each night, you reel in these nightmarish creatures from the depths, only to be harshly pulled from your slumber by the bartender, reminding you it\u2019s time for another dose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't just any night of drinking \u2014 <i>what you drink shapes your dreams</i>. Each bottle you choose carries its own artwork, and each design transports you to a new, eerie world with different mechanics and creatures to catch. In your dream, you become a fisherman battling the unknown, each area offering a unique challenge. Pick your poison wisely, because the fish you catch \u2014 and the story you unravel \u2014 depend on the bottle you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >On The Water</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore many different areas, and see what strange creatures go for your hook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/158e1bd3ecef442c47f22a35e96e8495.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new and interesting ways to explore the black sea around you! Each area will drop you in a completely unique setting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/c7ba5232c27debc4c858fcf212338149.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight weird monsters from the deep! Every area is home to its own boss, which will prove a challenge to catch! No two bosses will be caught the same way! You will have to use the tools around you to fell these fearsome beasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/39427d29fcdde825992ec95bc331a0cb.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the water can bite back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.poster.avif?t=1744474599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.webm?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534300/extras/d3706ea488f9b5c2be8d3ad5361eb9c9.mp4?t=1744474599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low Cup is a solo-developed indie game, made in the Unity game engine. All assets including scripts, art, and music are made by one person. The game is currently still in development, and all shown gameplay is subject to change and improvement.</p>",
